== Makefile examples ==

Here there are two examples about how use RT-Druid command line versions. In both makefile, main targets are:
* download or just update RT-Druid and Erika Enterprise
* configure the system
* build

The first [[Makefile:_RT-Druid_CLI_with_EE_svn | makefile]] gets Erika Enterprise directly from svn and the package with RT-Druid only. In this way it easier to read and modify Erika Enterprise files.

The second [[Makefile:_EE_RT-Druid_CLI | makefile]] gets the package with both Erika Enterprise and RT-Druid. The benefit is that this couple passed all tests we do before release RT-Druid packages.


